    "en": "After a nap, drowsiness collapses to 38 and fatigue to 5; the trip moves to after_rest_before_restart, stopped at an SA/PA. The service switches away from driving services to a post-rest one (stretch_video) and the fit resets low since the situational push is gone. At night the winner is the same track as the drive — the day journey's after-rest stage instead crowns a different, higher-arousal track, showing the night leaf's small but real pull.",
